{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Annoroid API","description":"Customer API: create jobs, upload data, track progress, download results.\n\n## API keys: test and live\n\nSend your key on every call as `Authorization: Bearer <key>` (or `X-API-Key: <key>`).\nAnnoroid issues two kinds, and the prefix says which:\n\n| prefix | what it does |\n|---|---|\n| `ann_live_...` | Real jobs: our team labels and reviews your data, and the work is billed. |\n| `ann_test_...` | The same API end to end (create a job, status, episodes, results, webhooks) for building your integration. Nobody works on test jobs: pipeline episodes are decided by the automated checks alone, and labelling tasks are approved at once with a placeholder result (no labels). Test jobs are small (at most 10 episodes or files), test keys have a lower rate limit (30 requests a minute; live: 120), and test jobs are deleted with their results after 7 days. Every job and result says `\"mode\": \"test\"` and `\"test\": true`. |\n\nTest and live never mix: a test key sees only test jobs and a live key only live ones; any\nother job answers 404. Keys of older form (`ak_...`) are live keys.\n\n## Job callbacks (webhooks)\n\nGive a job a `callback_url` when you create it, or set a default for your organization with\n`PUT /v1/webhooks`. We POST an event there whenever the job's status changes:\n`job.created`, `job.processing`, `job.in_review`, `job.delivered`, `job.failed`.\nCallback URLs must be `https` and must resolve to public addresses.\n\nEvery delivery carries these headers:\n\n| header | |\n|---|---|\n| `Annoroid-Event` | the event type, e.g. `job.delivered` |\n| `Annoroid-Event-Id` | `evt_...`, the same on retries and resends - use it to ignore duplicates |\n| `Annoroid-Delivery` | `whd_...`, this delivery |\n| `Annoroid-Timestamp` | Unix seconds when this attempt was signed |\n| `Annoroid-Signature` | `sha256=` + hex HMAC-SHA256 of `\"<timestamp>.<raw body>\"` with your webhook secret |\n\nAnswer with any 2xx within 10 seconds. Anything else (or no answer) is retried after 30 s,\n2 min, 10 min, 30 min, 1 h, 2 h and then every 3 h, for up to 24 hours. Recent deliveries,\nwith status codes and attempts, are at `GET /v1/webhooks/deliveries`; resend one with\n`POST /v1/webhooks/deliveries/{id}/resend`.\n\n### Verifying a delivery\n\nYour webhook secret (`whsec_...`) is shown once, when it is made (`POST /v1/webhooks/secret`,\nor from your Annoroid contact). Check every delivery before trusting it - over the raw\nrequest body, exactly as received:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib, hmac, time\n\ndef verify(secret: str, headers: dict, raw_body: bytes, tolerance_s: int = 300) -> bool:\n    timestamp = headers[\"Annoroid-Timestamp\"]\n    if abs(time.time() - int(timestamp)) > tolerance_s:      # too old: a replay\n        return False\n    expected = \"sha256=\" + hmac.new(secret.encode(), timestamp.encode() + b\".\" + raw_body,\n                                    hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    return hmac.compare_digest(expected, headers[\"Annoroid-Signature\"])\n\n# Flask:  if not verify(SECRET, request.headers, request.get_data()): abort(400)\n```","version":"v1"},"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"tags":["health"],"summary":"Service health","description":"`{\"status\": \"ok\"}` when the database and Redis both answer, otherwise 503.","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"503":{"description":"the database or Redis is not answering"}}}},"/v1/jobs":{"post":{"tags":["jobs"],"summary":"Create Job","description":"Creates the job and starts finding its episodes; poll GET /v1/jobs/{id}. A source that\ncannot be used (not found, private, unreadable, no known format) shows as status `failed`\nwith the reason.","operationId":"create_job_v1_jobs_post","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobIn"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["jobs"],"summary":"List Jobs","operationId":"list_jobs_v1_jobs_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobOut"},"title":"Response List Jobs V1 Jobs Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/jobs/{job_id}":{"get":{"tags":["jobs"],"summary":"Get Job","operationId":"get_job_v1_jobs__job_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Job Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JobOut"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/jobs/{job_id}/episodes":{"get":{"tags":["jobs"],"summary":"List Episodes","operationId":"list_episodes_v1_jobs__job_id__episodes_get","parameters":[{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Job Id"}},{"name":"status","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Status"}},{"name":"decision","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Decision"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":1000,"minimum":1,"default":100,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimu